S,G|INT. BUS - (DAY) - MEDIUM CLOSE SHOT
O|
N,I|Mr. and Mrs. Ben McKenna at the back of a motor coach
N,I,G|with their seven year old son, HANK. We do not see
N,G|much of the background which is receding from us.
N|THEY are studying the countryside from the windows at
N,G|each side of them. The CAMERA PULLS BACK down the
N,G|aisle of the bus revealing the other passengers. They
N|are a surprise, consisting of Arab men and women, with
N|an occasional civilian and French Army officer. The
N,G|CAMERA STOPS at the end of the bus.
O|
O|
