N,G|A closer view shows the terrified, tear-stained face
N|of Hank, and the tense features of Ben. Drayton seems
N,G|carefully alert. The CAMERA MOVES DOWNWARD in front
N,G|of them as they descend. The music coming from the
N|ballroom ceases, as Jo finishes her second song. There
N|is the sound of great applause. The three are about a
N|dozen steps from the bottom, when suddenly Ben shoots
N|out a hard and pushes Drayton forward. Taken by
N|surprise, he stumbles, and falls down the stairs
N|clumsily. Clutching for support with his hands, the
N|gun goes off in his pocket, and he remains in a crumpled
N|heap at the bottom of the stairs.
